Crossfire. Cannons scatter bombs across the arena; a bomb kills you on contact (-1). Reaching the green door wins the game (+5).

Tactic: advance toward the green door every turn, hugging walls for cover. If a bomb is flying at you, sidestep out of its lane — or hold still one turn behind cover to let it pass — then keep moving. Standing in the open just gives the cannons more shots at you.

